Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.78,0:24:08.96,Main,Both,0,0,0,,It's a new semester in episode 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.96,0:24:11.13,Main,Elisa,0,0,0,,"The Boy Who Is the World's \NStrongest Sorcerer...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.96,0:24:15.00,ep title,title,0,0,0,,Episode 8\NThe Boy Who Is the World's\NStrongest Sorcerer Faces the New Students.
